"Bereiche schnell erreichbar, gut lesbar und persönlich anpassbar bleiben."
msgstr "MyTools is a private Django platform for quick links, widgets, weather, notes, files, file conversion, profiles, chats and mini-games. Global search, quick actions, mobile navigation with a header toggle, unified tool pages and design options keep the many areas quick to reach, easy to read and personally customizable."

